<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>schwätz third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 15px/1.5 "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 6px; }
  ul.used-by { columns: 3 14rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>schwätz is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (see <code>LICENSE</code>
and <code>NOTICE</code>). It includes the following Rust crates, which are available under the
licenses below.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}{{#unless (eq id "GPL-3.0-only")}}  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/unless}}{{/each}}</ul>
{{!-- GPL-3.0-only is schwätz's own license (the workspace crates), already shipped as LICENSE. --}}
{{#each licenses}}{{#unless (eq id "GPL-3.0-only")}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used-by">
{{#each used_by}}  <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/unless}}{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
